# intercom.com — llms.txt

> This file helps large language models (LLMs) understand the content structure, canonical sources, and retrieval rules for intercom.com and its sister properties.

Fin (formerly Intercom) is the Customer Agent company delivering perfect customer experiences from support to sales to commerce. The company's primary site is [fin.ai](https://fin.ai/). intercom.com covers the Intercom Helpdesk, the company's human-agent workspace (omnichannel inbox, ticketing, Copilot, knowledge hub, reporting), used by 30,000+ businesses including Anthropic, Amazon, Miro, Linear, Lightspeed, Lovable, Perplexity, and WHOOP. The Helpdesk works alongside Fin, the company's AI Agent, so AI and human teams collaborate seamlessly.

For a description of Intercom, the Intercom Helpdesk, and how it works with Fin, see [Facts about Intercom](https://www.intercom.com/ai-instructions).

